    <div class="glass-card prose reveal-on-scroll">
      <h2>1. What Are Cookies?</h2>
      <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your browser or device when you visit websites. They help remember your preferences and keep your session secure.</p>

      <h2>2. Essential vs Analytics Cookies</h2>
      <p>Beyounge website uses minimal essential cookies for session navigation and anonymous performance analytics to ensure fast web load times. We do not use intrusive third-party cross-site advertising cookies.</p>

      <h2>3. Managing Cookie Preferences</h2>
      <p>You can configure your web browser settings to block or delete cookies at any time. Blocking essential cookies may affect navigation performance on our website.</p>
